mindmap
  root((Module 6 - Deploy a Blueprint))
    45 minutes
    Select Offer Blueprint
    Click Deploy
    Step 1 - Deployment Name
      Enter unique name
      Click Next
    Step 2 - Configuration
      Browse for input file - optional
      Fill required fields
      File Server Root Path
      Use DAP file server option
      Cluster Hosts table
        Add service_tag
        Add hypervisor_ip
        Add controller_vm_ip
        Click Add after each row
    Step 3 - Summary
      Review all values
      Click Deploy
    Navigate to Inventory Deployments
    Confirm deployment in list
    Checkpoint
      Deployment visible
      Status - Deployed or In Progress
